{"id":"db3828a463c18d8a","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-filter7-complete-ultrafilter.md","title":"ZFC Filter7 Complete Ultrafilter","display":"df-zfc-filter7-complete-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter7 Complete Ultrafilter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter7-complete-ultrafilter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter7-complete-ultrafilter"],"display":"df-zfc-filter7-complete-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter7 Complete Ultrafilter","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter7-complete-ultrafilter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter7-complete-ultrafilter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter7-complete-ultrafilter — ZFC Filter7 Complete Ultrafilter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(X,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7CompleteUltrafilter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7CompleteUltrafilter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}complete\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7CompleteUltrafilter}_S(X,\\mathcal U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,X)\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\\Bigl(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\{x\\in X:\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(x\\in A)\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}complete\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7CompleteUltrafilter}_S(X,\\mathcal U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,X)\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\\Bigl(|\\mathcal A|&lt;\\kappa\\to\\{x\\in X:\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(x\\in A)\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Intersections are taken relative to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>. In particular, the empty subfamily has intersection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, rather than invoking an undefined absolute <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcap\\varnothing\">\\(\\bigcap\\varnothing\\)</span> convention.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7CompleteUltrafilter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}complete\\text{-}ultrafilter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter7CompleteUltrafilter}_S(X,\\mathcal U,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_S(\\mathcal U,X)\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\\Bigl(|\\mathcal A|<\\kappa\\to\\{x\\in X:\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(x\\in A)\\}\\in\\mathcal U\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcap\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":1330,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1914","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-filter7-complete-ultrafilter.md|58-df-zfc-filter7-complete-ultrafilter]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}